  "reference_notes": "Compared the spring leafy multi-stem shrub and detailed paired foliage photograph, using leafless mass planting only for stool structure. The initial generic leaf sequence was corrected to opposite pairs along each daughter shoot; spread increased to 1.4 and twig radius reduced to 4 mm. Reviewed current seeds 1/4/7 and all 36 resulting variants. Irregular spreading canopies and separately connected basal stems now match the intended thicket architecture. Selected spring leaf flush before flower clusters; no fruit. The existing bark token does not reproduce red young twigs and leaf veins remain below 25 mm; those color/detail limits are recorded rather than claimed complete. Accepted geometry source, approximately 1.32-3.12 m.",
